						long: "The quincunx (also called inconjunct) is a challenging minor aspect of 150 degrees. It connects signs with nothing in common by element, modality, or polarity, creating an uneasy sense that something needs to change without a clear path forward. Unlike squares, which provoke direct confrontation, or oppositions, which create a tug of war, the quincunx produces a nagging feeling of misalignment. The two planets involved seem to operate in completely different worlds, requiring constant adjustment and compromise. Health issues, compulsive habits, and situations that demand adaptation are classic quincunx themes. When handled well, this aspect fosters resourcefulness and the ability to bridge seemingly incompatible parts of life.",
