				result: "Dhana Malika is one of the twelve Malika combinations, each named for the house its unbroken run of planets begins from. This one begins at the 2nd, the house of accumulated wealth, family resources and speech, and carries the run forward through the houses of effort, home, intelligence, obstacles, partnership and inheritance. The reading follows that shape. Wealth is tied into everything else rather than held apart from it, so resources, relationships and reputation tend to rise and fall together, and money is rarely a separate department of the life. A concentration of this kind is rare and it is emphatic rather than balanced: the same run that gathers seven grahas onto the wealth axis leaves five houses empty, so the chart tends to be decisive where it is occupied and thin where it is not.",
