			description: "The 15th combines the forward drive of 1, the versatility and appetite for experience of 5, and the care-centered orientation of the reduced 6. The result is one of the more immediately compelling birth day numbers: individuals whose personal presence draws attention without effort and whose genuine concern for others gives that magnetism a constructive direction. A notable specific gift is facility with language. Those born on the 15th tend to acquire and use language with unusual ease, whether in speaking, writing, or working across linguistic and cultural lines. Their love of the arts runs equally deep, particularly the visual arts. They approach creative work with both emotional investment and aesthetic discipline, a combination that allows them to produce rather than merely appreciate. Their determination, once engaged, is formidable. They rarely take over established enterprises; they build their own. The shadow of this strength is stubbornness: they persist in a chosen direction even when changing course would serve them better.",
