		summary: "The numerology chart shows a Life Path 8 (The Powerhouse), oriented toward achievement, authority, abundance energy. Expression number 9 reflects The Humanitarian capacities. Soul Urge 1 points to The Leader inner drives, and Personality 8 projects The Powerhouse outward. Birth Day 6 contributes a particular love quality. Maturity 8 indicates the orientation of later life toward The Powerhouse.The name carries 4 karmic lesson(s), each pointing to an area of underdeveloped experience that holds growth potential in this lifetime. Karmic debt 19 is present in the chart and warrants deliberate engagement. The current Personal Year is 8, a period oriented toward Ambition and Authority.",
