				result: "Dhana Yoga is a wealth combination and the classical treatment of it is unusually direct: one born to these combinations becomes wealthy. Read that as capacity to accumulate rather than as a promised sum. The pattern favours resources that stay, so earnings convert into assets, assets hold their value, and a standard of living rises without having to be rebuilt after every setback. Wealth of this kind usually comes through strengths the chart already carries rather than through windfall. Scale and timing belong to the rest of the chart and to the periods that bring these houses forward.",
