	dream: {
		id: "water",
		name: "Water",
		letter: "w",
		meaning: "The symbol of water constitutes for being one of the most common dream occurrences. Water acts as a metaphor reflecting our current emotional state, a powerful symbol that belongs to the emotional unconscious of the dreamer that is not fully understood. A symbol that needs to be translated for the dreamer to understand their emotions and feelings so they don’t overwhelm them in their lives. The color, shape, depth and location become a clue to help guide the dreamer to the true meaning.",
	},
	"angel-card": {
		number: "111",
		title: "New Beginnings, Manifestation, and Alignment With Your Highest Purpose",
		coreMessage: "Your focus is shaping what comes next. Give your attention to what you want rather than what you fear, because a new chapter is beginning.",
		type: "repeating",
		digitRoot: 3,
		meaning: {
			spiritual: "Angel number 111 is one of the strongest manifestation signals in the angelic system. When it appears, the energy around you is ripe for new beginnings, and what you hold in your attention tends to take form more readily than usual. The single 1 stands for initiative, independence, and the start of something, and tripled in 111 that creative charge is amplified. Think of it as a doorway: you are being invited to step into a fresh chapter and to notice where your thoughts have been pointing, because the conditions around you take their cue from them. Seeing 111 is less a promise than an instruction to mind what you are building.",
			love: "In love, 111 marks fresh starts and new possibility. For those who are single, it suggests that a meaningful connection may be forming, but it asks you first to align your own thoughts with the kind of love you want to receive. For couples, 111 is an invitation to bring renewed intention to the relationship: to talk honestly about a shared future and to set goals together. If you are healing from a difficult ending, 111 signals that the door to love is open again once you release what came before and let your heart settle.",
			career: "Professionally, 111 points to new opportunities taking shape. This is a favorable moment to start the venture, apply for the role, or launch the project you have been weighing, because your initiative carries extra momentum now. The number rewards leadership and original thinking rather than waiting for permission. Keep your attention on what you want to create, take concrete steps toward it, and stay alert to openings, since the conditions around you support a fresh professional direction.",
			money: "In money matters, 111 favors fresh starts. It is a supportive moment to open a new income stream, reset a budget, or change a financial habit, because the patterns you set now tend to take hold. Keep your attention on building rather than on the fear of lack, and pair the optimism with one concrete step, since 111 rewards initiative backed by action rather than wishful thinking alone.",
			twinFlame: "For twin flames, 111 is a significant marker of either an approaching meeting or a clear step forward on the journey. If you have not yet met, 111 suggests that a meeting is drawing nearer. If you are in separation, it is a message of hope: the inner work both of you are doing brings reunion closer, so focus on your own growth and trust the timing. For twin flames already in union, 111 encourages setting shared intentions, since your combined focus is especially creative now.",
		},
		biblical: "In the Bible the number 1 speaks of unity and primacy, the truth that God is one (Deuteronomy 6:4), and of beginnings. Read that way, 111 is sometimes taken as an emphasis on first things and singleness of focus. To be precise, though. Angel numbers as personal codes are not a biblical concept, and Scripture does not single out 111. Christian teaching locates guidance in the word of God, in prayer, and in community rather than in number sequences, so many readers treat 111 as a prompt toward intention rather than a message in itself.",
		shadow: "The shadow side of 111 is mistaking thought for action. The same focus that manifests can curdle into magical thinking, the belief that wanting something hard enough replaces the work of building it. It can also show up as restlessness, starting many new things and finishing none, or as impatience when results do not arrive on demand. When 111 keeps appearing, the honest question is whether you are taking real steps or only rehearsing the outcome in your head.",
		keywords: [
			"new beginnings",
			"manifestation",
			"initiative",
			"alignment",
			"fresh start",
			"leadership",
		],
		energy: "positive",
		affirmation: "My focus shapes my reality, so I give my attention to what I want to create.",
		actionSteps: [
			"Notice where your thoughts have been pointing, since they are taking form",
			"Set one clear, positive intention for what you want to begin",
			"Take a concrete first step on something new you have been postponing",
			"Watch for fresh opportunities and act on the ones that align",
			"Release a self-limiting belief that no longer fits the chapter ahead",
		],
	},
